OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fdry through the evening with
OL,7,Fincreasing clear spells and light
OL,8,Fwinds. Staying dry overnight and
OL,9,Fbecoming quite chilly. Slight frost in
OL,10,Fsheltered glens in Argyll.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FDry and bright but chilly
OL,13,Fstart. Sunshine turning hazy as cloud
OL,14,Fgradually spills east through the
OL,15,Fafternoon ahead of rain spreading east
OL,16,Ffrom late afternoon. Freshening
OL,17,Fsoutherly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
