OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloud
OL,6,Fand patchy rain clearing east on
OL,7,FFriday morning. Then bright spells and
OL,8,Fshowers and Friday and Saturday,
OL,9,Fbecoming quite frequent Friday night.
OL,10,FWindy as rain spreads east on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
